{"title": "Status properties/Burning", "pageid": 35340, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Status_properties/Burning", "categories": ["Status properties"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">Status properties</a>.</div>\n<p><b>Burning</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_property\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status property\">status property</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_with_Burning\">List of conditions with Burning</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Burning\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.</li>\n<li>Can be removed with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/38px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/50px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a> action, using a <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Healing Potion</a> or gaining <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a>.</li>\n<li>Immune from if <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dip\" title=\"Dip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp/25px-Dip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp/38px-Dip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp/50px-Dip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp/25px-Dip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Dip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dip\" title=\"Dip\">Dip</a> action can be used on Burning characters or objects.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Burning\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Orthonic)_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Orthonic) (Condition)\">Burning</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.</li>\n<li><b>CANNOT</b> be removed with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/38px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/50px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a> action, using a <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Healing Type Potion</a> or gaining <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Burning_Fiercely\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Fiercely_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning Fiercely (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning Fiercely\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Fiercely_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning Fiercely (Condition)\">Burning Fiercely</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Heat\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Heat_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_(Condition)\" title=\"Heat (Condition)\">Heat</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Engulfed by a vengeful fire. Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage each turn, but can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Convergence\" title=\"Heat Convergence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat Convergence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Heat_Convergence_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Convergence\" title=\"Heat Convergence\">Heat Convergence</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Heat Convergence</b> consumes all remaining turns of <b>Heat</b> to deal extra <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage on their next fire spell or attack.</li>\n<li><b>Heat</b> has a maximum <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 7 turns.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Holy_Fire\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Holy Fire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Holy Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Fire_(Condition)\" title=\"Holy Fire (Condition)\">Holy Fire</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">1~4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a> damage per turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Infernal_Burning\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Infernal Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Infernal Burning (Condition)\">Infernal Burning</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.</li>\n<li><b>CANNOT</b> be removed with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/38px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/50px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/25px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a> action, using a <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Healing Type Potion</a> or gaining <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Wet_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wet_(Condition)\" title=\"Wet (Condition)\">Wet</a>.</li>\n<li>The entity affected cannot regain <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Roiling_Hellfire\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roiling_Hellfire_(Condition)\" title=\"Roiling Hellfire (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Roiling Hellfire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Roiling_Hellfire_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Roiling_Hellfire_(Condition)\" title=\"Roiling Hellfire (Condition)\">Roiling Hellfire</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Flames from the heart of Avernus engulf this entity, inflicting <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">6d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage per turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Wild_Magic:_Burning\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Wild Magic: Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic: Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Wild_Magic_Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Wild Magic: Burning (Condition)\">Wild Magic: Burning</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage at the start of each turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200638\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2112/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38181/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8479/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 706767/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.172      1 Template:Status_property_page\n100.00%   49.172      1 -total\n 46.37%   22.800      8 Template:ConditionsTableRow\n 42.33%   20.813      8 Te